title: Consolidated triplicated aspect-anchor check into premise-core (v6.6.3)
summary: A second field report (not-chat) on pm_postflight aspect-drift false positives revealed the v6.6.2 fix had only patched one of three copies of the aspect-anchor existence check — paradigm review (CLI) and compliance-checker still had the bug. Consolidated all three onto a single checkAspectAnchors() helper in premise-core (the only package all callers can import), fixing the live CLI false positive and adding per-(aspect,anchor) dedup. Architect-designed, builder-implemented, reviewer-approved.
